<title>POLAND: VISTULA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>VISTULA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.40 vs   0.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.73 vs   0.84</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.41 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Sales		    8.73 vs   7.96</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.69 vs   6.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.02 vs  11.45</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.78 vs   7.36</p>
<p> Sales		   68.52 vs  55.67</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Vistula SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
